nDont know if this worked before.\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nWhen running `ngcc` for my own library ngcc runs without problem, but it does not produces correct d.ts files for generic types, respectively tested for pipes.\r\n\r\n## 🔬 Minimal Reproduction\r\n\r\nHere is repository with my sample package https://github.com/kukjevov/sample, there is compiled result that is used in sample https://github.com/kukjevov/ivy-code-size/tree/sample\r\nProblem is on line https://github.com/kukjevov/ivy-code-size/blob/ee0b7436a18770991c03065204b3038ced24ef99/node_modules/%40ng/sample/src/pipes/ngSelectValue.pipe.d.ts#L11 \r\n\r\n```typescript\r\nstatic ngPipeDef: ɵngcc0.ɵPipeDefWithMeta<NgSelectValuePipe, \"ngSelectValue\">;\r\n```\r\n\r\nthere should be \r\n```typescript\r\nstatic ngPipeDef: ɵngcc0.ɵPipeDefWithMeta<NgSelectValuePipe<any>, \"ngSelectValue\">;\r\n```\r\n\r\nTo reproduce problem:\r\n`git clone https://github.com/kukjevov/ivy-code-size sample-ivy`\r\n`cd .\\sample-ivy\\`\r\n`git checkout sample`\r\n`npm install`\r\n`git reset --hard`\r\n`npm run ngcc`\r\n`npm run build`\r\n\r\n## 🔥 Exception or Error\r\n<pre><code>\r\nnode_modules/@ng/sample/src/pipes/ngSelectValue.pipe.d.ts:11:47 - error TS2314: Generic type 'NgSelectValuePipe<TValue>' requires 1 type argument(s).\r\n\r\n11     static ngPipeDef: ɵngcc0.ɵPipeDefWithMeta<NgSelectValuePipe, \"ngSelectValue\">;\r\n\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n## 🌍  Your Environment\r\n\r\n**Angular Version:**\r\n*8.0.0-beta.8*\r\n\r\n**Anything else relevant?**\r\nWindows 10\r\nVersion\t10.0.17134 Build 17134\r\n**node** v10.13.0\r\n**npm** 5.3.0\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"matsko","id":93018,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93018?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko","html_url":"https://github.com/matsko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matsko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":